NT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 이전에 각 인재상별 인증 기준을 취득한 자에게도 적용</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 128.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -128.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">* 기타문의사항 : 478-7028(학사관리팀)<br><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 128.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -128.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">첨부&nbsp; 1. 인재상별 인증기준 1부.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 128.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -128.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 인재인증 신청 서식 1부.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 128.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -128.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 128.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -128.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">교 무 연 구 처 장</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: \" 고딕??=\"\" 맑은=\"\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: \" 고딕??=\"\" 맑은=\"\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: \" 한컴바탕??=\"\"><br></span></p></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
